/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 173 0 R
/T (This UX research analysis focuses on understanding user needs and behaviors related to our app. The goal of this study is to identify key pain points, expectations, and opportunities for improvement in order to enhance the overall user experience. To achieve this, data was collected through our survey, targeting different ages . The analysis is based on responses from 10 participants. This report presents the main findings, highlights recurring patterns, and translates them into actionable insights and user personas to support design decisions for the proposed solution.)
